Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: The Pendulum Chews the Pavement
- Story & Context: Jesse "Burl" Vance climbed into the steel framework of an Interstate 40 gantry during the freezing November sleet of 2014, his fingers smelling of rosin and hot solder as he spliced a battery-powered four-track into the overhead warning matrix. An accidental voltage bridge knocked out the state DOT sensor loop, causing the digital sign to glitch into a slow blinking rhythm while their live acoustic broadcast cut through car radios jammed for five miles down the gorge. Commuters killed their engines in the freezing fog, rolling down windows to listen as Jesse thumbed a thick, sleepy bassline over the hacked highway frequency. "Lord, break the gears before they break our bones," Maeve sang into a dented dynamic microphone, christening the first illegal broadcast before state patrol cars could trace the transmitter.
